# Project Rules for GEO Tool

## Stack (Never change these without asking)
- Frontend: Next.js 14 (App Router) + TypeScript (strict)
- Styling: Tailwind CSS
- Database: Supabase (Postgres)
- Auth: Supabase Auth

## Coding Rules
- Always use TypeScript strict mode. Never use `any`.
- Every API route must handle errors (try/catch).
- Keep components modular and small.
- Do not write massive files.

## Workflow
- Make ONE feature at a time. Do not build everything at once.
- After each file change, wait for my approval.